{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every morning the alarm clock kills me. This is a short visual novel about anxiety, cyclicity, and trying to wake up when it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not a hero. You're just not sleeping. Because you know: As soon as you close your eyes, it will ring again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alarm. Not just a device. He's alive. And he's waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What else awaits you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sinister comedy on the verge of sleep and madness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrealism Parade: milk with eyes, a talking refrigerator and a twin reflection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalistic visual presentation \u2014 images only</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack, disturbing sounds and loop feeling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievement for hugging the alarm clock</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world where time is the enemy, and every morning is a battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you set your alarm for 07:00 yet? He was waiting for you too.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u0421\u0440\u043e\u043a \u0433\u043e\u0434\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0438 \u2014 \u0432\u0435\u0447\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4078030/bda20fbc4a5c899d8da2939b89776957ffb4f72e.jpg"},{"name":"\u0417\u0435\u0440\u043a\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0430\u0442\u0430\u043a\u0430","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4078030/774d8d98344dd69befb5390b4535688e10d9f4dc.jpg"},{"name":"\u041f\u0435\u0442\u043b\u044f \u0437\u0430\u043c\u043a\u043d\u0443\u043b\u0430\u0441\u044c","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4078030/5d4752787449d7e3939e40d14697ed89c2ac1f37.jpg"},{"name":"\u0421\u04